      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&amp;gt;100 percent of all action items (48 actions) under the strategy have commenced and all are on track and are being implemented. Indicator evaluated as &lt;strong&amp;gt;&lt;em&amp;gt;Fully Achieved adn exceeded teh target.&lt;/em&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&amp;gt;?&lt;/p&amp;gt;</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="100/100"></actual>
    </period>
